<title>POLAND: KPBP Bick Q1 net rises to PLN 0.5 mln.</title>
<headline>KPBP Bick Q1 net rises to PLN 0.5 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>KPBP Bick preliminary results for the first quarter of the year ending March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q1 1997	Q1 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit			 0.17 vs	0.49</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			   0.61 vs	0.70</p>
<p>    net profit				 0.46 vs	0.37</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: KPBP Bick SA.</p>
<p>    net sales				 16.94 vs     14.36</p>
<p>    costs of sales			  15.12 vs     12.59</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		    na  vs	 na</p>
<p>    income tax				 0.15 vs	0.33</p>
<p>    other taxes				 na  vs	 na</p>
<p>    financial revenues		     7.11 vs	0.30</p>
<p>    financial costs			  6.68 vs	0.08</p>
<p>    investment				 0.08 vs	0.98</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
